 <a id="model-experience"></a>
+
+The Hero exposes a target-selector replacement with the directory selector as fallback, plus an adjacent options slot. Composer blocks are owner-scoped so one plugin cannot clear another plugin’s reason. Clearing a workspace target keeps an existing draft visible and read-only while the composer opens the target picker.
+
+UiConversation.inspect(target, entries) creates a readonly projection from an explicit event window using the registered target definitions. It does not mutate a Session binding, select history or dispatch model work.
